/- English proof (translation)
Proceed by induction. Treat this case separately. Treat this case separately. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules.
-/
private theorem hom_sum_apply {Γ : Type} [Group Γ] {A B : Rep.{0} ℂ Γ} {ι : Type} (s : Finset ι)
    (c : ι → ℂ) (f : ι → (A ⟶ B)) (x : A) :
    (∑ i ∈ s, c i • f i).hom x = ∑ i ∈ s, c i • (f i).hom x := by
  classical
  induction s using Finset.induction_on with
  | empty => simp
  | insert a s ha ih =>
    rw [Finset.sum_insert ha, Finset.sum_insert ha, Rep.add_hom, Rep.smul_hom]
    simp [ih]

/- English proof (translation)
Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses.

Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Apply the first step, then apply the next step to every resulting obligation. A detailed English derivation is pending.
